      "evidence_sha256": "52bb196ce88940a5ce5f50d585a4f2c630597bf8656c2b01b574387920778d6d",
      "assessment": "R5 G2 obtains incumbent-based strata and actual displacement after reducing interval1. Its source delta is -0.00329449; the much larger -0.0413632 comparator gap is selection-related. It writes zero win rate in every quartile although Q2 is 0.04 and maps drift cosines to wrong interval labels. Restoration and a terminal trim remain review-only.",
      "decision_update": "Retain fresh interval and subgroup evidence, but audit the numerical summary, index mapping and comparator identity before proposing a direction. Interpret the measured local decrement as such, and use a same-wave contrast where available to the later synthesizer.",
      "counterexample_or_limitation": "The statement that sub-0.05 differences are unreliable has no variance basis. Terminal trim efficacy is unknown, and large Q4 contributions do not alone identify a stochastic mechanism or justify ignoring Mean.",
